BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Center for Spiritual Living Santa Rosa
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261116T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261116T102500
DTSTAMP:20261113T221639
CREATED:20260714T192631Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260714T192633Z
UID:10005900-1794823200-1794824700@cslsr.org
SUMMARY:Generating Love
DESCRIPTION:Weekdays (Monday – Thursday)\nIn this live 25-minute meditation\, we recognize that Divine Love is within each of us. We come together in the experience of sharing and extending that love to expand a consciousness of a world that works for every one.\n\nThe Zoom link is https://tinyurl.com/GeneratingLove \n\nYou can also use a video of this meditation practice on your own at any time you choose. New video coming soon.\n\n\n\n.
URL:https://cslsr.org/event/generating-love-2022-05-04-2-2/2026-11-16/
LOCATION:Zoom
CATEGORIES:Free Events,Meditation
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://cslsr.org/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/love-scaled-e1600654727381.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Center for Spiritual Living Santa Rosa
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261116T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261116T130000
DTSTAMP:20261113T221639
CREATED:20260214T210739Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260214T210739Z
UID:10008580-1794830400-1794834000@cslsr.org
SUMMARY:Life Visioning Practice
DESCRIPTION:Visioning is the spiritual practice of tuning in to the Self within to receive guidance about our lives. The Life Visioning Practice group meets weekly on Zoom to support one another in visioning. In it\, you will be guided by one of our experienced Practitioners through the visioning process. If you would like to learn more and experience the benefits of visioning in your life\, this group is for you. \nJoin weekly on Mondays from Noon to 1 pm Pacific time on Zoom. Be sure to bring a journal to record your visioning results. \nClick here too join the Zoom. \n 
URL:https://cslsr.org/event/life-visioning-practice-2/2026-11-16/
LOCATION:Center for Spiritual Living\, CA
CATEGORIES:Groups,Life Visioning Practice,Meditation
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://cslsr.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/journal-2850091_1920.jpg
GEO:38.43058;-122.745975
END:VEVENT
